  state: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0b1149f4527d0e548b66028eff91b4db, type: 2}
  isAutomatic: 0
  ChangeTimeOfAction: 0
  Text: "The boy saw nothing. \r\n\r\"Leave the register alone? My boss would kill
    me!\"\n   \r\n\rBut he heard everything. \r\n\rAround 4 AM there were some weird
    mooing sounds, \u201CI thought maybe some <link>special cow</link> escaped or
    something, but then there were this loud screeching, and <link>something BIG</link>
    like mostly big crashed.\"\n\n\"I don't know what I heard later... it sounded
    like people, animals, cars, everything all at once, like a slow explosion. And
    then <link>something got on the roof</link>.\"\n\n\"You guys seem to know. How
    screwed are we?\"\r"
  TextForRepetition: 'We already did that, remember?

    The report is probably
    on your desk, or in the DB if you uploaded it.'
